# Architecture

## Source (`src/`)

**Core**: `index.ts`, `main.ts`, `cli.ts`, `browser.ts`
**MCP**: `McpContext.ts`, `McpResponse.ts`, `DevToolsConnectionAdapter.ts`
**Tools**: `tools/` (24 implementations)
**Web UI**: `web-ui.ts`, `web-ui-template.ts`, `web-ui-settings.ts`
**Utils**: `DevtoolsUtils.ts`, `PageCollector.ts`, `WaitForHelper.ts`, `Mutex.ts`
**Other**: `formatters/`, `telemetry/`, `trace-processing/`

## Build & Config

`build/` contains compiled JS from TypeScript. Key configs: `package.json`, `rollup.config.mjs`, `puppeteer.config.cjs`, `tsconfig.json`, `eslint.config.mjs`

## Testing

Tests in `tests/` mirror `src/` structure. Use `tests/setup.ts`. Snapshot tests use `.snapshot` files.
